{"id":"u-3a427441-12a3-4de8-ba44-3dcc460ad708","src":"community","title":"Vitruvian Symmetry","author":"Bryce  T.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/Z78Kce-bullmastiff-20-1","desc":"You’ve built the foundation with the heavy hitters; now it’s time to fill the gaps. Vitruvian Symmetry is a specialized powerbuilding bridge designed specifically for those coming off Bromley’s 70’s Powerlifter or Bullmastiff.Built on a 3-week volumizing block structure, this program shifts the lens toward symmetry and structural integrity. While the \"big dog\" programs prioritize raw tonnage, Vitruvian Symmetry hammers the muscle groups that often lag during heavy SBD-focused runs—specifically upper chest, biceps, abs, and calves.By utilizing a hypertrophy-first approach, you’ll pack on the \"missing\" mass needed to round out your physique without losing the strength you’ve earned. It’s the ultimate \"cosmetic overhaul\" for the heavy lifter: plugging the leaks in your kinetic chain and ensuring your aesthetics finally match your power.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":70,"joins":2,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-05-30T17:55:12.672Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3","Day 4"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"pct":60,"x":3}]},{"n":"Pec Deck (Machine)","sets":[{"r":15,"x":3}]},{"n":"Seated Row (Cable)","sets":[{"r":15,"x":3}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Single Arm Preacher Curl (Machine)","sets":[{"r":15,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":15,"x":3}]}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Hack Squat","sets":[{"r":10,"pct":60,"x":3}]},{"n":"Leg Extension","sets":[{"r":15,"x":3}]},{"n":"Hamstring Curl","sets":[{"r":15,"x":3}]},{"n":"Abs Crunch (Weighted)","sets":[{"r":15,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Seated Shoulder Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"pct":60,"x":3}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Close Grip)","sets":[{"r":15,"x":3}]},{"n":"Pull-Up (Assisted)","sets":[{"r":15,"x":3}]},{"